    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWINGS Saturday 26th Sept 11am-11.30am sharp. Saturday 3rd October 10am-10.30am sharp.\n\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis fine 2 bedroom, ground floor apartment represents a fantastic opportunity to purchase a holiday home in Kilkee, presented in turn key condition and at excellent value. It is ideally located within walking distance of the beach and all local amenities. Accommodation comprises 68 sq.m. and includes an open plan living and dining area, kitchen, store room, bathroom and two bedrooms. Externally, there is a patio with seating area. Due to the size and location of this property, it would make an ideal holiday home or investment property for long or short term rentals. Early viewings are advisable."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen - \nComplete with fully fitted wall and base units, tiled flooring and tiled splash back\n\nSitting Room/Dining Area - \nLocated to the front of the property, this bright and spacious room is complete with carpet flooring, tv point, and an electric fireplace.\n\nhallway - \nComplete with carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble bedroom complete with carpet flooring and rear aspect.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nAnother double bedroom also complete with carpet flooring and has a rear aspect.\n\n"
      },
